### EQ12 GODSTACK API Testing
### Test Ngrok tunnel status
GET http://127.0.0.1:4040/api/tunnels
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Test Grafana health (requires API key)
GET {{grafana_url}}/api/health
Authorization: Bearer {{grafana_api_key}}

###
### Test GitHub API connection
GET https://api.github.com/user
Authorization: Bearer {{github_token}}

###
### Test webhook endpoint (adjust URL for your ngrok tunnel)
POST {{ngrok_url}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "test",
  "source": "vscode_rest_client",
  "timestamp": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "data": {
    "test": true
  }
}

###
### Test EQ12 GODSTACK local services
GET http://localhost:8080/health

###
### Test Prometheus metrics
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=up

###
### Variables (create .env file with actual values)
# @grafana_url = http://localhost:3000
# @grafana_api_key = your_grafana_api_key
# @github_token = your_github_token  
# @ngrok_url = https://your-tunnel.ngrok-free.app